#13510
minotaur huge cyclopean~
the Cyclopean Minotaur~
A huge minotaur huffs as it circles the great chamber!
~
250 350 bdyIJKL cEG 5
1 0 0 13510 -1 13510
D
   The minotaur towers over you, taller than a house by half! It stomps its
heavy feet as it circles the chamber, filling the air with a cloud of fine dust
that lingers near the stone floor. When it turns to you, the minotaur eyes you
with one giant eye, right in the middle of its face. Long white horns extend
from its grizzled beard, curving upward; surely those will be the last thing
you see if you can't find a way past.
~
