chamber! Her face is that of a horse, with fiery eyes and steam rising from her
flaring nostrils. Her torso and arms, wrapped in strips of red linen, are that
of a woman. Her waist is at floor level, semi-transparent, unconstrained by the
geometry of the floor. There's no way past her!
~
