#13520
#n wily man~
Wily #n~
A man is pacing back and forth, checking stones on the walls.
~
250 350 dvJL cEM 3
1 0 0 13520 -1 13520
D
   At first, it looks like you've found a friendly face in these dank depths.
But as he comes into view, holding a crude torch made from a tent pole, his
appearance paints a different picture. His uneven hair stands up on one side,
but it's shaved nearly to the bone on the other, with fresh scabs dried blood.
Few teeth remain in his mouth, but those that do are stained a deep orange.
His eyes dart back and forth, never stopping. He's rail thin and half-dressed.
And worse, he's muttering to himself. Looks like he's been down here a while.
~
