champion horned #n~
the horned champion~
A horned champion emerges from the shadows, staring off into the darkness.
~
250 350 duvJL cE 3
0 3 0 13530 -1 13530
D
   The champion is imposing, with a stature that rivals the largest men you've
seen. Two upturn horns, tan at the base and darkening to black at the tips,
grace the sides of the head, which is covered in thick, shaggy hair not unlike
a bison. Wide soot lines decorate the champion's face in a puzzling pattern,
with the lips and area around the mouth blackout out completely. Below that,
you can make out a sleeveless, knee-length woolen tunic with heavy embroidery.
~
