gilded light across the dark stone walls. The spider holds perfectly still as
you approach. You can't see its eyes to tell if it's awake or asleep. A closer
inspection reveals an exciting truth: the spider has covered itself in bits of
golden treasure! Oh, but it's not as much gold as it first seemed: the spider's
mirror-like silver body makes it look like so much more.
